.DS_Store
*.swp

# Vendored Helm dependencies ARE committed in this repo, unlike jdwlabs/deployments
# which gitignores charts/*/charts/ and rebuilds from Chart.lock. That repo's
# dependencies are file:// siblings already present in the checkout; this one
# pulls from an external Helm repository, so leaving it unvendored would put an
# upstream fetch in ArgoCD's render path — a failure mode that only shows up as
# a broken sync. Vendoring keeps the chart self-contained and deterministic.
